text = "Be quick, even if he gets [color=#915577]patience[/color] when he gets fed, he still loses it when you're not looking at [color=#2d2730]him[/color].
There is a cooldown so you'll have to wait between feeds, and you can't feed him if he's full.
[right][color=#2d2730]Good luck!"
